        "params": {
          "text": "MIDI HAMMOND + LESLIE\n\nLoad any MIDI file and play it through\nHammond B3 organs + Leslie rotary cabinet.\n\nRouting:\nMIDI Seq (4 tracks) -> 4 Pipe Organs\n  -> ADSR+VCA per track\n  -> Mixer -> Leslie 122 -> Hall Reverb -> Out\n\nTrack registrations:\n1: Full drawbars (lead)\n2: Flute voicing (harmony)\n3: Soft pad\n4: 16'+8' bass pedals\n\nTips:\n- Load a MIDI file in the sequencer\n- Toggle Leslie SLOW/FAST!\n- Drive 0.5+ = rock organ\n- Try Bach, jazz standards, gospel\n- 6 voices per track for full chords"
        }
